 "text": "Hello there, how are you today? Lightly wrapped in thin layer of foil, it won't mash entirely. Sandwich ingredients are the real space criminals, though, how much they pack packs makes a difference. A sandwich for each morning and an fruit one midway. A tough bag of chips and a box of crackers would be my packed and picked foods. A thin sandwich doesn't take it and you' still have room for sweeties. A box of crackers and a dip would do nicely, or some thin sandwiches and some biscuits. The important thing is it all fits. Not if you' keeping an eye on weight. A clean plate every morning can add up.",
